0002>).\nThus to conclude it suffices to prove that <MATH_0014> is quasi-compact\n(Lemma <REF_0003>).\nIf <MATH_0015> is representable, then <MATH_0016> is a scheme\nand <MATH_0017> is quasi-compact.\nIf <MATH_0018> is representable by algebraic spaces and quasi-separated,\nthen <MATH_0019> is a quasi-separated algebraic space\nand hence decent (Decent Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0004>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:514290624f6065914ba7e8b08e6a9d1d3870bb2816ba0d826d8d8581aef3e0c9", "unit_id": "tag:0GW3:proof"}
